[{"id":2795209738,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mm4QK","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think it's fine to do it outside of `is_inside_tree()`. However, my only concern is that `on_skeleton_update()` might be called twice (from inside `_check_bind()`) when `is_inside_tree()` is `true`.\r\n\r\nSo how about:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid BoneAttachment3D::set_bone_idx(const int &p_idx) {\r\n\tif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\t_check_unbind();\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tbone_idx = p_idx;\r\n\r\n\tSkeleton3D *sk = get_skeleton();\r\n\tif (sk) {\r\n\t\tif (bone_idx <= -1 || bone_idx >= sk->get_bone_count()) {\r\n\t\t\tWARN_PRINT(\"Bone index out of range! Cannot connect BoneAttachment to node!\");\r\n\t\t\tbone_idx = -1;\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\tbone_name = sk->get_bone_name(bone_idx);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\t_check_bind();\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\ton_skeleton_update();\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tnotify_property_list_changed();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine